1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 17=

10
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,280
Is it all done?

11
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:53,350
I saw the tea spill onto her
with my own eyes.

12
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,350
It's colorless and leaves no trace.

13
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:56,710
Qi Yuan,

14
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,390
because of you, my son was stripped
of his title and rank.

15
00:01:00,430 --> 00:01:03,000
You should have seen this day coming.

16
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:07,400
I got the Lost-Soul Incense
from Prince Qi.

17
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,200
When you breathe in
the flower's fragrance,

18
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,910
your limbs will go weak,
and you'll lose consciousness.

19
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,150
And you'll be at my mercy.

20
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:24,350
If she were reciting scriptures,

21
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:25,760
how could there be no sound at all?

22
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,000
Please reconsider, Your Highness.

23
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,710
Entering the inner palace
without permission is a capital offense.

24
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:30,510
Why not ask the Crown Princess
to step in?

25
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:31,590
Mother is in the Eastern Palace.

26
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:32,790
There isn't time.

27
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:34,400
If anything happens to Qi Yuan.

28
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:34,950
Your Highness!

29
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:36,000
Your Highness!

30
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:38,280
Your Highness,

31
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,480
Prince Jing is here.

32
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,310
This is the inner palace.

33
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:43,230
I doubt he'd dare intrude.

34
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,200
Come now, beauty.

35
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,590
No one I want

36
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:53,400
has ever escaped me.

37
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:10,840
You...

38
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:22,910
It's you.

39
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:25,520
What?

40
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:27,710
Did you think I was dead?

41
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,080
I just didn't expect you

42
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:34,590
to save me.

43
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,960
Don't flatter yourself.

44
00:02:40,150 --> 00:02:42,190
I have a private grudge
against this beast.

45
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,000
Help me.

46
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,000
Who is there?

47
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,460
How dare you break into
Her Highness's bedchamber?

48
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,460
Open your eyes wide.

49
00:03:20,580 --> 00:03:21,680
(Jing)
This is Prince Jing.

50
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:23,590
Forgive me, Your Highness.

51
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:24,870
Consort Little Liu has ordered

52
00:03:24,870 --> 00:03:26,430
that no one may enter today.

53
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,030
Trying to run?

54
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:31,190
Beast!

55
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:32,310
Let me go.

56
00:03:36,910 --> 00:03:38,710
Weren't you so fierce just now?

57
00:03:38,910 --> 00:03:40,960
Still trying to act smug in front of me?

58
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:43,120
I will destroy you anyway.

59
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:48,870
Prince Jing?

60
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:54,190
Consort Little Liu has ordered

61
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,710
that no one may enter today.

62
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,680
Move aside.

63
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,630
I will destroy you anyway.

64
00:04:12,231 --> 00:04:18,691
♪Leaves fall in the cold wind,
a fleeting glance between pavilions♪

65
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:26,580
♪Still unable to step out of this
devout dream until the end of time♪

66
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:33,920
♪Love drifts through the whirlpool
of farewell, brushing past me♪

67
00:04:34,050 --> 00:04:39,710
♪Only longing
leaves me wounded all over♪

68
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:43,640
♪Yet I still fear you'll forget me♪

69
00:04:43,650 --> 00:04:44,910
I entered the palace
by imperial decree.

70
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,560
Please spare me, Your Highness.

71
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,720
I can't.

72
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:53,120
I went to see Prince Qi.

73
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:55,750
I have no idea

74
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:58,040
what kind of person I was

75
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,430
in my past life.

76
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,630
But if what Prince Qi said is true,

77
00:05:03,390 --> 00:05:05,560
that I used you to gain a bright future,

78
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,690
then it's only right for you

79
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:08,430
to hate me.

80
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,430
I didn't know these things before.

81
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:12,120
I forced you to love me.

82
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,120
But now,

83
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,600
I will never force you even a little.

84
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,360
I'll give you my whole heart

85
00:05:18,490 --> 00:05:19,680
and ask for nothing in return.

86
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,000
If you wish to be with me,

87
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,160
nothing would make me happier.

88
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,480
If not,

89
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,240
I won't blame you.

90
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:38,190
But I want you to know this

91
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,160
that in this life,

92
00:05:40,830 --> 00:05:41,920
I, Xiao Yunting,

93
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,000
will never hurt you again.

94
00:05:45,290 --> 00:05:49,890
♪To change an uncertain fate,
never part again♪

95
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:54,870
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

96
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:57,920
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

97
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,530
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion♪

98
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,830
You're fine now.

99
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,470
I'll take you home.

100
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:07,910
♪Love is a miracle♪

101
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,920
Prince Jing,

102
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,950
how dare you break into the inner palace.

103
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,510
This is a capital offense.

104
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:16,290
Are you not afraid
His Majesty will hold you accountable?

105
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,430
Your Highness,
don't be so quick to accuse.

106
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,070
Why don't you explain

107
00:06:20,330 --> 00:06:22,560
why Miss Qi, who entered the palace
by imperial decree,

108
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:25,190
ended up being drugged in your palace?

109
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:25,830
How insolent!

110
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,560
The inner palace is a forbidden ground.

111
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,820
Where would any drug come from?

112
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,160
Your Highness, we've checked.

113
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,240
Prince Cheng is not in the palace.

114
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:37,680
No one saw him come or go.

115
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,560
The drug leaves no trace.

116
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:41,160
They have no evidence.

117
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,480
I'm dizzy right now.

118
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:55,480
I need to go outside and get some air.

119
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:57,870
Stop right there.

120
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:01,160
Since you insist on leaving,

121
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,800
I'll grant your wish.

122
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,190
As for the charge of trespassing,

123
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,800
I've warned you.

124
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,120
Your Majesty,

125
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:25,310
Prince Jing defied palace rules

126
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:26,630
and broke into Siliu Pavilion.

127
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:29,000
You must stand up for me.

128
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:30,430
Xiao Yunting,

129
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,890
do you know
you have committed a capital crime?

130
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,120
I'm willing to die.

131
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,000
But please let me finish speaking.

132
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:39,720
At noon today,

133
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:42,830
Miss Qi Yuan
of the Marquis Yongping Residence

134
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:44,300
was to meet me outside Donghua Gate,

135
00:07:44,430 --> 00:07:45,510
but she never arrived.

136
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,040
I was worried for her safety,

137
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:48,670
which is why I broke into Siliu Pavilion.

138
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,950
But when I arrived,

139
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,950
Miss Qi had already been drugged

140
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:52,950
and was unconscious.

141
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,000
If I had been a moment later,

142
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,040
the consequences
would have been disastrous.

143
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,920
Drugged?

144
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,480
Your Majesty,

145
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,420
it's impossible

146
00:07:58,440 --> 00:08:00,190
for something so vile
to be found in Siliu Pavilion.

147
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:02,680
I beg Your Majesty
to investigate at once.

148
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,630
If there's no evidence,

149
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,800
please deal with this
according to palace law.

150
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:07,750
If no solid proof is found,

151
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,240
I'm willing to take my own life

152
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,920
to set the record straight.

153
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,780
(Tower of Remembrance)

154
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,270
How could this have happened?

155
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:18,920
Your Majesty,

156
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,830
when I found Miss Qi,

157
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,390
she was injured near here.

158
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:23,950
If I had been any later,

159
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,270
she might have lost her life.

160
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:40,270
Your Highness.

161
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:41,550
Your Highness.

162
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,360
Prince Cheng has a knife wound.

163
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,670
If his body is found,

164
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,910
it would inevitably

165
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:46,790
be traced back.

166
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:58,670
Consort Little Liu,

167
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:00,510
why are there so many buried bones

168
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:02,630
in the inner palace?

169
00:09:02,630 --> 00:09:04,150
What is going on here?

170
00:09:05,190 --> 00:09:06,390
I beg you to judge this fairly.

171
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,910
I know nothing about this.

172
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,630
It was her.

173
00:09:10,910 --> 00:09:12,790
She must've done this behind my back.

174
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:14,390
Your Highness,

175
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:16,840
you ordered me to...

176
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,030
You insolent servant!

177
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:19,000
How dare you falsely accuse me?

178
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,670
That's enough.

179
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:22,360
Consort Little Liu,

180
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:24,390
you have disappointed me.

181
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:25,870
Draft the decree.

182
00:09:26,450 --> 00:09:28,690
Consort Little Liu has allowed
her servants to commit murder.

183
00:09:28,700 --> 00:09:29,990
She is to be demoted to concubine rank

184
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:31,270
and confined for three months.

185
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,150
Yes, Your Majesty.

186
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:33,030
Your Majesty...

187
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,990
Prince Jing broke into the inner palace.

188
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,240
Though it was to save someone,

189
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,550
his conduct was reckless.

190
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,510
Punish him with twenty lashes

191
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:44,440
as a warning.

192
00:09:45,550 --> 00:09:46,500
Thank you, Your Majesty.

193
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:50,120
Your Majesty!

194
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,120
Your Majesty!

195
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:14,620
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

196
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:18,780
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

197
00:10:19,290 --> 00:10:24,750
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

198
00:10:24,970 --> 00:10:29,130
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

199
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:34,200
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

200
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:41,900
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
